  <h2>Why a pen name</h2>
  <p>Research on this site is collaborative: one person funds an account, another verifies terms, another writes. A single byline keeps articles attributable without inventing personal biographies. We do not claim credentials, employers, social profiles, or personal gambling experience for this name, and we do not use an AI-generated face; the avatar is a monogram.</p>

  <h2>Responsibilities under this byline</h2>
  <ul class="tick-list">
    <li>Reading operator terms of service and recording effective and access dates.</li>
    <li>Running funded redemption tests under the site <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</li>
    <li>Writing and maintaining the research articles listed below.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Review and update policy</h2>
  <p>Every article is reviewed by a second member of the research team before publication. Material corrections are recorded in the article change log. Articles are re-checked when an operator changes its terms, and the "last updated" date reflects the most recent material review.</p>

  <h2>Disclosures</h2>
  <p>Some articles contain affiliate links. Compensation never affects a rating, a ranking or a measured figure. Full details on the <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure page</a>.</p>

